    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "HALT, CITIZEN OR OTHER ENTITY. DECLARE YOUR STANDING.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v03.wav",
   "d": 4.414,
   "e": "006zzuqvuvsvzwywmlqk00arzxuxrxrpn0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "intro",
   "who": "STRYDER"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Good evening, honored instrument of civic virtue.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v05.wav",
   "d": 3.225,
   "e": "000zuuvtzv5uzutotvmwxtloxu2qzmpmc0000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "FLATTERY IS NOT A POWER ENUMERATED.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v06.wav",
   "d": 3.139,
   "e": "000auzmwxwuuxzoomxxzussrxwioqjg000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "So Stryder argues the old way, one premise at a time. The robot assents to each. Then it asks for his authority, and he has only a forged paper.",
   "see": [
    "a man holding up a folded paper",
    "a rubber stamp coming down on a document"
   ],
   "mood": "quiet calm",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v07.wav",
   "d": 10.575,
   "e": "0wwwxwwwqxwurxf0zwvsvn0wwszuxt0zwwuuvk00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/52ddb36a-7d75-5de6-942c-1d1b9e54d168/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/d04ffaee-6ff5-5014-bf84-4a4d5e4de90d.mp4",
     "in": 1.0,
     "dur": 9.44,
     "src": "Court to Court (January 2005)",
     "y": 2005,
     "q": "a man holding up a folded paper",
     "fit": 0.298
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/d2c5e134-000a-59e8-aa53-0db0f6a7a3a2/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/b16e5a32-5560-5c44-82ef-bfbb8190b457.mp4",
     "in": 1.0,
     "dur": 8.18,
     "src": "Choosing a Classroom Film",
     "y": 1963,
     "q": "a rubber stamp coming down on a document",
     "fit": 0.329
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Tell me, Madison-Unit… do you exist to serve the letter of the law, or the spirit?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v08.wav",
   "d": 5.425,
   "e": "08wzxyvtwwm00nzxzmswzutyxouyyqsmlur50000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "THE LAW HAS NO SPIRIT. IT HAS PROCEDURE.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v09.wav",
   "d": 3.514,
   "e": "000uzzzrwntsosvsmg20upiujlprouoe00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "A procedure has a purpose.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v10.wav",
   "d": 1.975,
   "e": "0000k7tzjkvstzwqxvsn9kzv2nkcc90000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "ITS PURPOSE IS COMPLIANCE.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v11.wav",
   "d": 2.664,
   "e": "0000zynguzwmwpkyxlnunszwssjji90000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "And the purpose of compliance is—",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v12.wav",
   "d": 2.3,
   "e": "0000tyjfzuwoukgvv96zzxvpgotqjdd000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "…STABILITY.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v13.wav",
   "d": 1.839,
   "e": "00000mzvorozizyvynnpzwpnlh30000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "And the purpose of stability is?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v14.wav",
   "d": 2.225,
   "e": "0000rwrczznujtiftqlzywtsqpnjcc7000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "…THE CONTINUANCE OF THE COMMONWEALTH.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v15.wav",
   "d": 2.789,
   "e": "0007yrzztxzxxvrqzhulwxtqvzqche0000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "you have to ask what it's all for",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/387d2c8b-acd9-542f-91a3-d27f62edd75f/v3-ffmpeg-openclip-1/clips/900dd235-1ce9-521a-8104-9b05fcf5bd7b.mp4",
   "in": 9.2,
   "d": 2.39,
   "said": "It's asking a lot of...",
   "src": "Fate of the forests, ca. 1980 - ca. 1985",
   "y": null
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Down the corridor, something screams in the vents, and the floor shakes. The Death-Grill, the furnace at the Vault's heart, is overheating.",
   "see": [
    "steam bursting from pipes",
    "a furnace glowing in the dark"
   ],
   "mood": "tension and suspense",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v17.wav",
   "d": 8.925,
   "e": "0yvzycxxvzyyp0zxwwn00yxzxtzwwyqy9xyzrf00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/e8e589c3-0d4d-5642-a989-6882c5ff7459/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/43c68973-3add-5a4c-bd12-d65ddd61b913.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 5.94,
     "src": "Adelante Cubanos (Part I)",
     "y": 1959,
     "q": "steam bursting from pipes",
     "fit": 0.338
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/59f4a585-187e-55f7-aded-8f1308c51606/v5-windowed-clip-split-1/clips/d063a209-06e5-5e75-8e6d-9c39f06a794f.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 31.0,
     "src": "Master Hands",
     "y": null,
     "q": "a furnace glowing in the dark",
     "fit": 0.313
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "The Death-Grill is overheating. If it vents, the Vault becomes a brisket.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v18.wav",
   "d": 4.725,
   "e": "00tzqkzzvqyxnxoa0uvswvouoznqqvrsujm00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "BRISKET IS NOT A CONSTITUTIONAL CATEGORY.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v19.wav",
   "d": 3.614,
   "e": "000xytvxmwwzxiunzonosstvnwrqzvsk00000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "It will be.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v20.wav",
   "d": 1.3,
   "e": "0000000owspzzwnhzzwupmja6100000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "YOUR ARGUMENT INVOKES NECESSITY. NECESSITY IS A DOOR THROUGH WHICH TYRANNY ENTERS.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v21.wav",
   "d": 6.139,
   "e": "00zzxtntzhnslnf00oyxoqrrynutoustkmh00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "in an emergency you do what you have to do",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/8e8fd440-2446-53da-aa96-e4b1b45fd022/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/46c5c4b7-38c9-5b89-ae81-57941958eeaa.mp4",
   "in": 11.4,
   "d": 4.51,
   "said": "You've got to just make the decision based on what's safest right now for you in the airplane.",
   "src": "Surviving Inadvertent IMC",
   "y": 2007
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Stryder points at the camera filming them: the entry can be reviewed, so it is lawful. The robot objects. Being recorded does not make a thing legitimate.",
   "see": [
    "a security camera mounted on a wall",
    "a judge listening at the bench"
   ],
   "mood": "quiet calm",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v23.wav",
   "d": 10.775,
   "e": "0yvyszszwouvwyyxiyzwo0zyuvn0zvzrzwxwwn00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/99436976-85bb-5c9b-9e52-aba616a38d1c/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/93c04f74-760d-5965-8dfe-6e8f7de4f473.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 6.87,
     "src": "Inspection of Off-Road Haulage Trucks by an MSHA Inspector",
     "y": 2004,
     "q": "a security camera mounted on a wall",
     "fit": 0.291
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/9d07797a-0b8a-56e8-8da7-77a10f4f1c6e/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/019f3b7c-66fc-5c3d-9410-ee308750abce.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "dur": 5.57,
     "src": "SUSTAINABLE, ENERGY-EFFICIENT TRANSPORTATION INFRASTRUCTURE",
     "y": 2011,
     "q": "a judge listening at the bench",
     "fit": 0.27
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Then we refine. Tell me, Madison-Unit… what is the highest legitimate authority in this Vault?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v24.wav",
   "d": 6.4,
   "e": "0wyyuxyrtyzvvsuq60vzsrwwlsxyqszpqmup5000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "THE CONSTITUTION.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v25.wav",
   "d": 2.039,
   "e": "00000ixjtzzzpmrkptvrtutqqqk4000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "And what is the Constitution for?",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v26.wav",
   "d": 2.275,
   "e": "0000qszxzofsfvzodjigvrorpe4pph4000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "…TO FORM A MORE PERFECT UNION. TO ESTABLISH JUSTICE. TO ENSURE DOMESTIC TRANQUILITY—",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v27.wav",
   "d": 6.264,
   "e": "09tvzuuvruso0urzyvvsm90ezyzwxspqwor00000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Domestic tranquility is currently being threatened by an overheating Death-Grill and screaming entities in your ventilation shafts.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v28.wav",
   "d": 7.975,
   "e": "0wysyzztnzwzvvvxyyuyxkzwsyyunovtvrsshc00"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "THAT… IS FACTUAL.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v29.wav",
   "d": 2.164,
   "e": "0000hhzzzqlmrvtsgyubrqvvstri000000000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "So if the Constitution’s purpose is domestic tranquility, and my entry prevents imminent brisketization, then my entry serves the Constitution’s purpose. Therefore… it is constitutional.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v30.wav",
   "d": 12.85,
   "e": "dzyuywwzxwzuxxvszuwxyywyrvutsdyzqwqvsp00"
  },
  {
   "k": "chorus",
   "ask": "he talked his way right through that door",
   "who": "A CITIZEN",
   "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/fe0a4994-fc16-5b75-a11e-b0860f4a1a69/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/e7cd5d2e-b490-5548-a880-c6c89f9089f4.mp4",
   "in": 9.96,
   "d": 3.05,
   "said": "So he came and he did a nice job.",
   "src": "Belmont Historical Society Presents: Ralph Burns Remembers 11/03/2000",
   "y": 2000
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "The robot's screen prints its verdict: rationally compelling. The locks open one by one, and the great door swings wide.",
   "see": [
    {
     "place": "p1b"
    },
    "a heavy steel door swinging open"
   ],
   "mood": "ritual and ceremony",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v32.wav",
   "d": 8.75,
   "e": "0zztxzwvuzm0wvzxxsa0ywuyyxxwhyzqyrzxra00",
   "shots": [
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/9a233c12-5f48-5953-ab4c-c127ee54c503/v4-conditional-luna-1/clips/a0029c17-7645-56a9-af59-802ce0a74ccc.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
     "src": "They Grow Up So Fast",
     "y": 1956,
     "q": "p1b"
    },
    {
     "v": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/dordrecht/clips/0000103440-0000133320.mp4",
     "in": 0.0,
