     "q": "a heavy steel door swinging open",
     "fit": 0.268
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "ACCESS GRANTED UNDER THE DOCTRINE OF NECESSARY VIRTUE. YOU ARE HEREBY TEMPORARILY COMMISSIONED AS— A PERSON I DISAGREE WITH.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v33.wav",
   "d": 8.564,
   "e": "0vwuzwtvturwvr000zxzwvttvvzl0wzqqqzr0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "MADISON-UNIT 3",
   "text": "NOTE FOR THE RECORD: IF YOU BECOME A TYRANT, I WILL WRITE A VERY STRONGLY WORDED OPINION.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v34.wav",
   "d": 6.914,
   "e": "0rznzxtvj00twvwtzqkvvzxxvzrxuzvprqtg0000"
  },
  {
   "k": "talk",
   "who": "STRYDER",
   "text": "Make it concise. The world’s ending.",
   "wav": "pilot/ep15/v35.wav",
   "d": 2.625,
   "e": "000nyirdwvlwzvkhc0qtwzzugdqvrnf800000000"
  },
  {
   "k": "narr",
   "text": "Inside, the control room hums. At its center glows a lever marked Sun, simulated, do not touch. Stryder draws his blade and reaches for it anyway.",
